Lane plug-ins for tools/hao-check (bench's image check, gates v0.0.1; pm item bench/20261117-1358).
One POSIX sh file per lane area, named LANE-AREA.sh (e.g. runtime-swift.sh, metal-render.sh, patcher-kexts.sh,
diag-regressions.sh). Each runs on the laptop's dev image as root over SSH with OUT (a folder for evidence), CUSER and CUID
(the console user) set, bounded (no hangs), and prints one line per check:
    HAOCHECK CHECK <name> <PASS|FAIL|SKIP> <detail> [issue=#N]
A check that names its issue (issue=#N) is that issue's regression check. No persistent changes; no secrets.
Add yours by a commit to tools/hao-accept/hao-check.d/checks in this repository.
